    {
      "duration_ms": 10000,
      "caption": "Mutators split each module into variants for arch, image and link type.",
      "narration": "Mutators then clone each module into variants. One cc_library may become arm64 and arm, core and vendor, shared and static builds.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Variants via mutators",
